        <Param val="Visual Search Task&amp;#10;&amp;#10;On every trial a &quot;+&quot; appears, followed by a scatter of letters.&amp;#10;Exactly ONE letter is a T (it can be rotated). All the others are Ls.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Find the T and CLICK on it with the mouse as quickly and accurately as you can.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;There are 200 trials.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Click the mouse to begin." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text" />
